* Brief overview of the video
II. Unboxing and First Look (0:30 - 2:00)
* Unbox and showcase each USB-C hub
* Discuss initial impressions and build quality
III. Features and Specifications (2:00 - 4:00)
* Compare ports, HDMI output, and charging passthrough
* Discuss any notable features or drawbacks
IV. Benchmarking and Testing (4:00 - 6:00)
* Test each hub''s performance and charging speed
* Discuss results and any surprises
V. Conclusion and Recommendation (6:00 - 7:30)
* Summarize key findings and pros/cons of each hub
* Provide a clear recommendation for the best budget pick
VI. Forward Loop (7:30 - 8:00)
* Tease upcoming content and encourage viewers to subscribe', '2026-11-14T13:41:30.586Z', '2026-11-14T13:41:30.586Z');
