2. **C Hub** - Visual composition: close-up shot of a single USB-C hub with a bold, black background and white text overlay. Image prompt: highlight the hub''s build quality and design.
3. **Tech Faceoff** - Visual composition: side-by-side comparison of the three hubs, with a bold black or white background and colorful text overlay. Image prompt: showcase each hub''s unique features and specifications.

